# Requests the maintainer's review on every pull request that someone else
# opens, Dependabot included (#269). GitHub never requests a review from a
# pull request's own author, so the maintainer's own pull requests do not
# change.
#
# Review is requested, not required: main has no branch protection or
# ruleset that requires code owner approval. Adding that rule would block
# the maintainer from merging their own pull requests.
